== K. the gap bound: a continuity bound B_k across k group intervals must admit the design point (2J + 601 k, J = 1,426 ns, 300 ppm; 601 ns is KL_crf_rx's rate term per 2 ms) and still catch a half-sample step (B_k < 10,417 - 2J - 601 k)
k=1: need  3453 <= B_k <  6964  window exists; B=4096 inside; tolerance at 300 ppm J <= 1747 ns, at 0 ppm J <= 2048 ns
k=2: need  4054 <= B_k <  6363  window exists; BGAP=5120 inside; tolerance at 300 ppm J <= 1959 ns, at 0 ppm J <= 2560 ns
k=3: need  4655 <= B_k <  5762  window exists; BGAP=5120 inside; tolerance at 300 ppm J <= 1658 ns, at 0 ppm J <= 2560 ns
k=4: need  5256 <= B_k <  5161  NO window; BGAP=5120 outside; tolerance at 300 ppm J <= 1358 ns, at 0 ppm J <= 2560 ns
k=5: need  5857 <= B_k <  4560  NO window; BGAP=5120 outside; tolerance at 300 ppm J <= 1057 ns, at 0 ppm J <= 2560 ns
generic E8 closed-loop bound for ANY sequence of E8 rates (|rate error| <= 2J/8): 2.125 * 2 * 1426 / 8 = 758 ns
random independent PDU loss p: a restart needs two adjacent loss-voided groups; groups per second 500; rate ~ 500 q^2, q = 1 - (1-p)^16
